 "resources": [
  {"id":"31fb1bce-2cdc-57e1-ada0-e1215eba6c60","title":"RPE guide","body":"RPE is how hard the set felt, out of 10.\n\n## RPE scale\n| RPE | Reps left | How it feels |\n|---|---|---|\n| 10 | 0 | No more reps possible |\n| 9 | 1 | One more rep |\n| 8 | 2 | Two more reps |\n| 7 | 3 | Three more reps, speed still good |\n| 6 or below | 4+ | Warm-up effort |\n\n## Ranges\nWhen a range is listed (for example 8.5–9), finish the set inside it. If you blow past it, drop the weight next set.","url":null}
 ],
 "coachNotes": "Two full-body sessions a week. Do the warm-up and hip mobility circuit before each session and the foam rolling circuit after. Rest 60–90 s between sets."
}$doc$)
