 "resources": [
  {"id":"288f9d1b-e26a-51bb-9e1a-aceb4909064c","title":"RPE guide","body":"RPE is how hard the set felt, out of 10.\n\n## RPE scale\n| RPE | Reps left | How it feels |\n|---|---|---|\n| 10 | 0 | No more reps possible |\n| 9 | 1 | One more rep |\n| 8 | 2 | Two more reps |\n| 7 | 3 | Three more reps, speed still good |\n| 6 or below | 4+ | Warm-up effort |\n\n## Ranges\nWhen a range is listed (for example 8.5–9), finish the set inside it. If you blow past it, drop the weight next set.","url":null}
 ],
 "coachNotes": "Learn the box squat and set up the trap bar the same way each week. Keep a steady pace and aim for RPE 6–7."
}$doc$)
]::pg_temp.seed_revision[]);

